WEBVTT

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:06.000
<b>Teasing Master Takagi-san 3</b>

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:10.040
<b>Students who</b>

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:10.040
<b>are Independent</b>

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:10.040
<b>and Strive for Wisdom,</b>

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:10.040
<b>Virtue, and Health.</b>

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:10.040
<b>Culture</b>

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:10.040
<b>Fest</b>

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.960
<b>CULTURE FEST</b>

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:18.420
<b>"Amen Somen"</b>

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:18.420
<b>Eat-in Diner</b>

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:17.330
Can you put that over there?

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:18.250
I'm on it!

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:20.420
<b>Class 2-2</b>

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:22.040
Oh, my beloved princess! Romiya!

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:25.960
I'll never forget the fall day that we stood under
the trees with chestnuts dropping on our heads,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:31.000
because that's when my heart skipped a beat and I was
struck by cupid's arrow, oink!

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:37.830
A lowly pig like you doesn't deserve Princess Romiya
for a bride, so I'll put a stop to your wedding!

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:40.460
I am no pig, oink!

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:43.670
Then explain why you keep squealing like one!

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:45.130
Oink, oink?!

00:00:45.130 --> 00:00:47.420
I'm going to separate you from the princess forever!

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:48.580
All done!

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:49.830
You won't beat me so easily!

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:49.670
Thank you.

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:52.000
For I have the great Excalibur!

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.880
What!? That's the legendary sword!

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:53.670
Stop right there!

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:55.540
What are you doing?

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:59.500
Heh. This is what we in the biz like to call "improv"! Oink!

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:00.290
Huh?!

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:03.000
I had a brilliant idea last night.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.580
I figured the audience would bust a gut if I fought
the wizard by using some magic of my own.

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:07.880
Nice, bossman!

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:09.880
We don't need any of your ideas!

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:11.540
Listen up!

00:01:11.710 --> 00:01:18.330
<b>Romiya and Juliot</b>

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:15.380
Romiya and Juliot is supposed
to be a tragic romance story!

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:18.670
Because at the end of the play,
they both die in the name of love!

00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:22.960
Sanae worked hard to write this scene to thrill
the audience before they get moved to tears!

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:23.960
I think it works.

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:24.670
Huh?

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:27.000
We're gonna use Kimura's idea.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:27.960
What?!

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:28.960
Yes!

00:01:28.670 --> 00:01:29.790
Way to go!

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:31.710
Thank you, oink.

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:36.130
Whatever. Moving on, get yourselves
ready for the next scene!

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:38.170
Hey there! Here comes monkey!

00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:38.830
Pheasant!

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:39.630
Dog!

00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:41.330
A-and dumplings!

00:01:41.710 --> 00:01:45.630
Ta-dah! We're here to protect Prince Juliot and
Princess Romiya from any trouble!

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:48.210
Perfect! This is where Romiya comes in and says...

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:49.750
Huh? Wait.

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:50.920
Where is Takagi-san?

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:51.580
Oink.

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:53.500
Thanks for waiting!

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:57.000
Check it out! Romiya's costume is all finished!

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:00.790
Wow.

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:09.960
Okay. Let's pick the scene back up.

00:02:11.210 --> 00:02:14.540
Thank you, everyone!
I feel perfectly safe with you around!

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:16.710
Um...

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:20.330
Princess Romiya! If you'd like...

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:24.250
Uh... p-please feast upon these dumplings!

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:26.250
Oh my, for me?

00:02:26.630 --> 00:02:27.670
Are you sure?

00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:29.130
O-of course!

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:31.250
Um, er, uh...

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:35.880
"Eat one and it dries up all your tears,
eat two and they make you smile."

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:37.920
"That is the power of these special dumplings."

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:38.830
Get it right!

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:41.540
I'm sorry...

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:48.540
<b>Culture</b>

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:48.540
<b>Fest</b>

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:47.420
Culture fest!

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:54.960
Hey, kids. Brought some snacks for you.

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:03.580
Getting to stay at school until super late
with everyone is pretty exciting, huh?

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:04.540
You think?

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:07.380
Yeah, we should just have a sleepover here!

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:10.210
We'll change the lighting for this scene and then...

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:10.210
Hey Yukari-chan, aren't you going to eat?

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:14.960
Tomorrow's the day of the big show! And as the director,
I'll get all the blame if something goes wrong!

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:16.960
If you're not hungry, then I'll eat for you.

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:20.710
I'll walk you home tonight, Mano.

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:21.500
Okay!

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:25.630
Just put all your trash in here.

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:27.250
Thanks!

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:28.540
Bye bye!

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:30.420
Um, hey Takagi-san!

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:33.330
Are you free after this?

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:34.170
Huh?

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:35.920
Can you meet me on the roof?

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:41.630
Sure, no problem.

00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:45.380
I already finished eating,
so I'll go up there and wait for you.

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:46.500
Uh, okay!

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:49.290
Great!

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:53.250
Now I can get her to help me
practice my lines for the play.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:56.250
Tenkawa-san got upset when I forgot them earlier.

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:01.040
And since it's a scene where I talk with Princess
Romiya, I'm glad Takagi-san said yes!

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:05.380
<b>Class 2-3</b>

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:05.130
What role are you playing, Hojo?

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:14.210
<b>Haunted</b>

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:14.210
<b>House</b>

00:04:05.710 --> 00:04:07.130
The Good Witch.

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:10.880
I'm the character who guides Princess Romiya
and Prince Juliot to Onigashima.

00:04:10.880 --> 00:04:11.880
Like in Momotaro?

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:13.830
Yeah, the play is a mix of different stories.

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:16.960
Neat. That sounds like fun.

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:23.500
<b>The Chowhound Cafe</b>

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:23.500
<b>Big Sizes For Big Stomachs</b>

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:22.420
Wow. So your class is running a cafe, huh?

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:23.420
Yeah.

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:26.630
It's a lot of work since all the portion sizes are huge.

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:30.580
Well then, I'll swing by tomorrow to cheer you on.

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.000
Nah... that's okay.

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:38.130
I'm gonna have my hands full doing
prep work tomorrow, so don't bother.

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:39.580
Oh...

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:42.170
Let's both do our best tomorrow. Later!

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:50.830
I thought he'd be happy...

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:52.920
Yeah, totally!

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:57.920
I doubt anybody would bother
coming all the way to the roof.

00:04:57.920 --> 00:05:00.250
So it's the perfect place to practice!

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:06.290
Princess Romiya! If you would like,
please feast upon thes-

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:07.380
I'm seriously thinking about
asking Goto-kun out on a date.

00:05:07.630 --> 00:05:09.040
You know, during the Culture Fest!

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:11.080
Wow! You should totally go for it!

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:12.210
My fingers are crossed for you!

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:12.880
Thanks!

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.830
Wait. Now that I think about it...

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:21.670
Did I even tell Takagi-san that I wanted her
to help me practice for the play?

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:27.750
Oh god, I hope she doesn't think I'm going to ask her out!

00:05:28.750 --> 00:05:32.710
Before Culture Fest... at sunset... on an empty roof!

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:35.960
That's, like, the exact situation you'd ask a girl out!

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:40.210
It actually reminds me of volume 5,
chapter 7 of "100% Unrequited Love"...

00:05:40.710 --> 00:05:41.380
Eep!

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:44.710
Just admit it, already.

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:47.830
It's obvious. You want to spend
the Culture Fest together with me, don't you?

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:51.000
Squeeeee!

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:53.040
There was a scene just like that!

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.750
Crap! What am I gonna do?!

00:05:58.790 --> 00:05:59.750
I know!

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:01.670
Yo, Takagi-san.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:04.460
Well, let's get to practicing for the play!

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:09.080
Just like that! I'll gently ease things in a direction
away from anything romantic!

00:06:10.130 --> 00:06:12.250
All right! Nice idea!

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:15.080
I'm such a genius! That will definitely work!

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:22.210
Yo, Takagi-san.

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:23.210
Well, let's get to prac-

00:06:22.630 --> 00:06:24.000
Oh, hey Nishikata.

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:25.960
I've been waiting.

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:32.630
What is happening?
I'm definitely not here to ask her out, but...

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:34.420
I can't help but think about it!

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:38.040
D-don't get the wrong idea, Takagi-san!

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:40.880
I only asked you up here to practice for the play...

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:41.670
What the?

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:44.130
Fudge! I dropped my script!

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:47.580
Oh no! An awkward pause will just make this worse!

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:49.080
Come on!

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:51.420
Just spit it out!

00:06:52.630 --> 00:06:54.380
Um, hey, listen...

00:06:57.290 --> 00:07:00.500
So, like, th-the thing is...

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:02.920
Hey, do you mind if I go first?

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:03.540
Huh?

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:08.040
I think you're about to say the same thing I am, anyway.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:13.210
Takagi-san?! The same thing?! Does that mean...

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:17.170
So, hey, Nishikata.

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:18.920
I actually...

00:07:19.880 --> 00:07:22.790
Sh-she's gonna ask me out?!

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:24.830
No! Wait!

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:26.130
I just...

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:28.460
I would like to practice my lines with you!

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:29.460
Huh?

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:39.170
<b>Romiya and Juliot</b>

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:35.170
You got a mouthful from Tenkawa-san earlier,
so you want to practice too, right?

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:39.170
I feel like I haven't gotten my scene
with Dumpling A quite right yet.

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:40.960
So I want you to help me out.

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:45.330
Besides, I said it after you lost the other day.
You have to help me practice.

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:46.130
Oh...

00:07:46.130 --> 00:07:50.830
Huh? Did you think we were going
to talk about something else?

00:07:53.460 --> 00:07:58.290
You're such a goofball. Forgetting to say why you
wanted to meet and then getting all nervous about it.

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:01.460
Wh-who said I was nervous? Because I'm not.

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:03.580
Curse you, Takagi-san!

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:05.790
Okay, let's get in some practice.

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:08.670
But for a split-second there...

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:10.330
I did have my hopes up.

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:11.330
Huh?

00:08:13.170 --> 00:08:16.630
Thank you, everyone!
I feel perfectly safe with you around!

00:08:17.670 --> 00:08:19.420
The next line is yours, Dumpling A.

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:22.000
U-uh...

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:27.080
Princess Romiya! If you would like,
p-please feast upon these dumplings!

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:30.460
Oh my, for me? Are you sure?

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:34.710
Of course! Eat one and, um...

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:37.080
"And it dries up all your tears", right?

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:38.040
Oh, that's right!

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:40.920
Eat one and it dries up all your tears...

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:46.880
<b>CULTURE FEST</b>

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:45.000
Where should we go next?

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:48.290
Please come check out our stand!

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:52.670
We have a lot of different events continuing
throughout the day, so please enjoy!

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:54.710
Give me a bite!

00:08:54.710 --> 00:08:56.000
Thank you for coming.

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:58.460
What is that, mommy?

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:12.750
Future me is gonna write about today in his biography
as the day when I finally achieved my greatest triumph!

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:12.790
<b>Gym Event</b>

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:12.790
<b>Schedule</b>

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:14.500
I just know it!

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:19.130
I thoroughly checked every event in the Culture Fest
pamphlet for an opportunity! And it worked!

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:23.920
I found something that I know I can beat Takagi-san
at, with five billion percent certainty!

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:25.170
And that is...!

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:28.460
The Haunted House!

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:30.830
<b>Entrance</b>

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:32.920
I'm gonna challenge Takagi-san

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:37.210
to a contest where the winner will be
whoever can get in and out of here the fastest!

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:41.000
Welcome to spooksville.

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:48.750
Th-that being said, I'm not unshakable. Monsters
do kinda sorta freak me out just a tiny little bit.

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:50.000
But it's okay!

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:55.540
<b>The Man-Eating</b>

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:55.540
<b>Diner</b>

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:53.130
Because I'm gonna go through it about 10 times

00:09:53.130 --> 00:09:55.540
beforehand until I'm super familiar
with everything that's inside.

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:58.880
Then once I conquer my fears, I'll go invite Takagi-san!

00:09:58.880 --> 00:10:02.040
I'll bait her by saying: "I'm spooked since
I haven't been to it yet!"

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:03.040
And then!

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:08.790
<b>EXIT</b>

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:08.040
You okay, Takagi-san? It's been 10 minutes now!

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:09.250
Eek! I'm too scared to move!

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:12.500
It's an absolutely flawless plan.

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:15.540
I'm going to beat Takagi-san this time for sure!

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:17.630
Okay, let's get started.

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:19.170
Nishikata!

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:21.000
TAKAGI-SAN?!

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:22.790
I figured that you'd be here.

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:25.130
Wh-whatever gave you that idea?!

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:29.920
Oh, just a hunch I had. I thought you might
want to have a contest at the haunted house,

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:34.080
which meant you would probably come here early
and check what's inside to try and beat me.

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:37.920
No way! I... I would never!

00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:43.170
Well, whatever. Since we're both here,
let's have a contest!

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:44.880
What do you want the rules to be?

00:10:45.460 --> 00:10:49.880
How about we time each other going through
and whoever has the faster time wins?

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:51.330
Faster time?

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:53.580
Yeah! We each go through it alone.

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:55.580
Alone, huh?

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:57.630
I gotta stay calm.

00:10:57.630 --> 00:11:01.540
It doesn't matter if I'm afraid, I just have to run
through the haunted house like lightning!

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:03.290
Then I'll be the winner!

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:05.130
Sounds good.

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:07.420
So, are you okay with me going first?

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:08.380
Sure!

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:11.920
I won't stop the timer until you're out.

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:12.920
Okay.

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:14.880
Ready? Start!

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:20.790
How long will it take her?

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:24.920
With a name like "Man-Eating Diner",
it's gotta be hella scary!

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:35.920
G-gosh, I sure hope Takagi-san is okay in there...

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:37.290
Goal!

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:38.130
Huh?!

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:40.040
Already?!

00:11:42.460 --> 00:11:44.290
43 seconds, huh?

00:11:44.290 --> 00:11:45.460
That's pretty average.

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:47.330
Y-yeah, it is...

00:11:47.630 --> 00:11:49.580
So what was like it inside?

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:54.630
I'm not really sure. It was all a blur since I ran through.

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:57.170
My flawless plan, ruined!

00:11:57.580 --> 00:12:00.460
But I will say, it's pretty intense!

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:02.790
There were way more monsters than I expected.

00:12:02.790 --> 00:12:04.460
Th-that's just great...

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:06.420
I have to win this thing!

00:12:06.710 --> 00:12:09.080
Okay, now it's my turn.

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:13.380
Hey, Nishikata.

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:15.290
Did you hear?

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:19.710
Rumor is there's a real monster blending in
among all the fake ones in the haunted house.

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:25.000
And get this, if that monster manages
to tap you on the shoulder 4 times...

00:12:25.080 --> 00:12:28.420
they say you'll be trapped inside of there for eternity.

00:12:29.880 --> 00:12:32.580
Th-that sounds like a bunch of baloney!

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:35.670
Another one of Takagi-san's ploys, obviously!

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:37.330
Okay, here I go!

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:40.040
Ready? Start!

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:44.540
I'm just gonna run like crazy and make for the exit!

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:46.790
SKIRT STEAK!

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:48.500
FILLET!

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:50.790
BEEF UTERUS!

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:57.170
Something just... tapped my shoulder twice...

00:12:58.040 --> 00:12:59.420
And a third time!

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:03.250
If that monster manages to tap
you on the shoulder 4 times...

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:06.380
they say you'll be trapped inside of there for eternity.

00:13:08.130 --> 00:13:09.330
F-four times!

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:14.420
Takagi-san?!

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:17.040
You just ran off before I could say anything.

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:20.420
I came to tell you that the timer hasn't started yet.

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:22.130
Are you freaking kidding me?!

00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:23.460
Plus...

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:25.540
I wanted us to go together.

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:26.210
Huh?

00:13:28.380 --> 00:13:29.170
Wha?

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:31.210
You... what?

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:32.670
It's because...

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:34.040
MAY I TAKE YOUR ORDER?!

00:13:37.130 --> 00:13:39.750
You always have the most hilarious reactions, Nishikata!

00:13:37.380 --> 00:13:45.750
<b>Admission</b>

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:46.880
DARN YOU, TAKAGI-SAAAAAAN!

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:50.580
I think we should go over this way next.

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:54.210
Hey, what are you getting for lunch?

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:55.460
Nothing.

00:13:55.750 --> 00:14:00.250
My stomach can't handle any food right now.
Not until I know the play is safely over.

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:03.290
You can't skip lunch! You gotta eat to have energy!

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:07.670
Thank you all for waiting! We're pleased to announced
the eating contest will be beginning soon!

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:07.670
Let's see, I think you should have...

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:09.210
How about that?

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:12.880
<b>2 PERSON TEAM EATING</b>

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:12.880
<b>Contest</b>

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:13.790
Okay, folks! Ready?

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:15.380
Man, it's hot under here...

00:14:14.710 --> 00:14:15.380
Start!

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:16.880
Let's go, Yukari-chan!

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:18.250
Here!

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:20.210
Ow! That's hot!

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.630
She totally missed her mouth...

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.040
Oh, it went in that time.

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:26.540
Hot! Too hot!

00:14:34.960 --> 00:14:37.920
I'm gonna have my hands full doing
prep work tomorrow, so don't bother.

00:14:40.710 --> 00:14:42.540
It kinda pisses me off.

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:45.960
<b>CLASS 2-3</b>

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:48.290
Welcome home!

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:49.960
My Master!

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:58.330
Wait, your cafe... was a maid cafe?

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:03.830
That's why I told you not to bother coming!

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:08.420
That looks good on you.

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:12.210
Kimura won't stop! Just how much can this boy eat?!

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:10.880
Th-thank you for your kind words...

00:15:11.830 --> 00:15:12.920
My Master.

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:21.920
Your attention please. The play by class 2-2,
Romiya and Juliot, will be starting shortly in the gym.

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:19.920
<b>Romiya and</b>

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:19.920
<b>Juliot</b>

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:22.540
<b>A Play by Class 2-2</b>

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:22.540
<b>Romiya and</b>

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:22.540
<b>Juliot</b>

00:15:23.170 --> 00:15:24.500
Fall is so nice.

00:15:24.710 --> 00:15:26.830
Just look at all the chestnuts on the ground!

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:28.880
You there!

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:32.670
What do you think you're doing,
trespassing on my castle grounds? Oink!

00:15:32.880 --> 00:15:35.790
My apologies, sir. I was just lost in thought.

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:40.630
Wait, does my pigly appearance not frighten you? Oink!

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:43.790
Not at all. How could I be scared
of someone with such kind eyes?

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:47.000
My name is Romiya. Who are you?

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:48.420
I am... whoa!

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:51.580
I am Prince Juliot! Believe it or nut!

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:51.080
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:15:56.750 --> 00:16:02.580
<b>Romiya and</b>

00:15:56.750 --> 00:16:02.580
<b>Juliot</b>

00:15:57.420 --> 00:16:02.580
I want to stay by your side.
Even if that means defying fate itself!

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:04.630
I feel the same!

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:09.460
I don't care what may await...
even if it brings us great despair!

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:10.330
Oink!

00:16:10.960 --> 00:16:13.040
Then allow me to aid you.

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:15.790
I am the White Witch.

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:19.250
Do you two know about Onigashima?

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:20.710
What's that?

00:16:20.920 --> 00:16:24.000
It is a terrifying island that's crawling with Oni.

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:29.170
If you flee to that island, then I'm certain not even
the Black Wizard will chase after you.

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:31.080
Wow! That's wonderful!

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:31.920
Oink!

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:33.290
It's going really well!

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:36.000
We made it all the way to the Onigashima scene...

00:16:37.710 --> 00:16:40.750
We're here to protect Prince Juliot and
Princess Romiya from any trouble!

00:16:41.170 --> 00:16:44.630
Princess Romiya! If you would like,
please feast upon these dumplings!

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:47.580
Oh my, for me? Are you sure?

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:48.710
Of course!

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:53.460
Eat one and it dries up all your tears,
eat two and they make you smile!

00:16:53.750 --> 00:16:56.130
That is the power of these special dumplings!

00:16:56.420 --> 00:16:57.670
Oh, how joyous!

00:16:57.670 --> 00:17:01.170
With so many strong allies on my side,
I feel full of courage!

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:06.500
Whew. My part is over.

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:08.170
Prince Juliot!

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:12.380
I do not care if you look like a pig!

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:17.170
If they had stuck with the Frog Prince,
that would be me out there...

00:17:17.670 --> 00:17:19.290
I'll stay by your side forever!

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:21.380
Huh?

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:27.460
Am I crazy? Or is she... looking at me?

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:32.540
Princess Romiya! I feel the same about you, oink!

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:37.460
No, that's impossible.

00:17:39.170 --> 00:17:41.670
Come, you must hurry! Run this way!

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:44.460
Where do you think you're going?

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:49.420
There's no escape for you now.

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:56.040
Presto chango! Now you become a haaaaam!

00:17:56.790 --> 00:17:58.500
Princess Romiya!

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:05.630
Prince Julioooooot!

00:18:12.420 --> 00:18:15.330
After this part ends, it's finally time for the climax!

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:18.790
The only thing left now is for Romiya and Juliot to die.

00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:21.250
Nice job.

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:22.540
Aw crap!

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:26.380
I... I ate too much!

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:28.040
Huh?!

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:33.710
Prince Juliot... he turned into a ham.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:36.670
I'm sorry, I don't know what to say.

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:40.000
Could you give me some time alone?

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:50.040
Prince Juliot...

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:53.330
I made you a promise. I will...

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:55.540
never leave you alone!

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:02.000
Just wait. Because...

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:03.830
I'm coming to join you now!

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:07.170
Oh no!

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:19.710
Wh-why is Nishikata wearing the costume?!

00:19:25.880 --> 00:19:27.000
Oh fudge!

00:19:29.630 --> 00:19:31.000
What do I do?!

00:19:41.040 --> 00:19:42.710
P-Princess Romiya!

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:45.830
I escaped the curse of becoming a ham!

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:49.540
And even better, I've returned to my human form,
as you can clearly see!

00:19:50.670 --> 00:19:53.130
Th-there's only one way to explain it!

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:57.080
It's a miracle that was born from the love that we share!

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:02.250
A miracle... of love!

00:20:07.670 --> 00:20:11.080
I knew it. We were destined to be together.

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:14.880
Ever since that spring day...
when we first met each other.

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:17.540
"Spring day"?

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:20.580
You are... my one and only...

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:22.170
prince charming!

00:20:29.710 --> 00:20:31.670
What's going on? Huh?

00:20:51.210 --> 00:20:55.670
<b>KARAOKE ROOM</b>

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:55.670
Well, our play turned out to be a huge success,

00:20:55.670 --> 00:20:58.330
and that's thanks to each and every one of you.

00:20:58.330 --> 00:21:02.790
It wasn't without some accidents,
but everyone really did their best!

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:06.630
Oh, come on. The only "accident" was all your fault.

00:21:06.630 --> 00:21:08.000
We're gonna turn you into a ham.

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:10.420
Cheers.

00:21:10.420 --> 00:21:11.580
Cheers!

00:21:14.130 --> 00:21:15.750
The play sure was fun, huh?

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:17.000
For the most part.

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:21.830
But I totally freaked out after Kimura said "you handle
the rest" and then just left before the last scene.

00:21:22.330 --> 00:21:24.880
The way that you improvised the ending was amazing.

00:21:25.250 --> 00:21:28.580
I was so on edge that I don't even remember what I said.

00:21:31.420 --> 00:21:33.630
Well, I remember each and every second of it.

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:39.830
Hey, Takagi-san. I have a question
about one of your lines.

00:21:39.830 --> 00:21:44.880
You said "spring day", but I thought
they met each other during the fall?

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:48.040
It was spring when we met each other.

00:21:48.330 --> 00:21:49.000
Huh?

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:54.290
"We"...?

00:21:56.750 --> 00:21:57.670
Wait...

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:00.500
Does she mean...?

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:02.830
Takagi-chan!

00:22:03.080 --> 00:22:05.000
It's your turn to sing next!

00:22:05.000 --> 00:22:05.710
Okay!
